dateien.proben/eingang.json:
{
 "_": "Probe of what /api/eingang of the txtme chat (backstage-online/api/eingang.js) returns: {eintraege:[{id, zeit, art, name, email, text, consent, source, sprache, erledigt}], gesamt}. Names and addresses are invented (example.com). «vor» [days, hour, minute] replaces zeit so the demo always looks current; «entwurf» is the prewritten draft reply of the demo (no model call) and «verlauf» the chat conversation where the request came from the chat window. Facts in the drafts come only from gast_wissen.txt.",
 "gesamt": 6,
 "eintraege": [
  {
   "id": "probe-1", "vor": [0, 9, 40], "art": "support", "name": "Tom Verbeek", "email": "tom.verbeek@example.com", "sprache": "en",
   "text": "Hi, I ordered a black T-Shirt Festival Print in L on Saturday (order 10482) and haven't received a shipping mail yet. When does it ship, and can I track the parcel?",
   "consent": true, "source": "support", "erledigt": false,
   "verlauf": [
    ["user", "I ordered a tee on Saturday, order 10482, no shipping mail yet. When does it ship?"],
    ["assistant", "I can't see orders or parcels here. For the status of an order, write to customer-support@txtme.social with your order number.\n- Shipping: included in the price, every parcel insured\n- Delivery times: not on the website yet"],
    ["user", "Ok, then please pass it on to the team. Tom Verbeek, tom.verbeek@example.com"]
   ],
   "entwurf": {
    "betreff": "Your order 10482",
    "text": "Hi Tom\n\nThanks for your message. We're checking order 10482 right now: [CHECK ORDER] and we'll send you the shipping confirmation with the tracking link as soon as the parcel leaves.\n\nEvery parcel goes out insured, and shipping is included in the price. Delivery times per country are not on the website yet, so we'll tell you the expected date with the confirmation.\n\nSee you offline.\n\n[Name], txtme.social, Buikslotermeerplein 1726, 1025 XL Amsterdam, The Netherlands, customer-support@txtme.social",
    "team": "Basis: shipping-payments (insured, shipping included, delivery times to follow)\nOpen: order 10482 in the shop system; expected delivery date"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "probe-2", "vor": [0, 11, 5], "art": "presse", "name": "Jonas Keller", "email": "j.keller@example.com", "sprache": "de",
   "text": "Guten Tag, ich schreibe für ein Magazin über europäische Alternativen zu den grossen Social-Media-Plattformen. Wäre ein kurzes Interview mit dem Gründer möglich, und gibt es Bildmaterial und Logos für den Druck?",
   "consent": true, "source": "press", "erledigt": false,
   "entwurf": {
    "betreff": "Interview und Material für deinen Beitrag",
    "text": "Hallo Jonas\n\nDanke für dein Interesse. Ein Interview mit Marouan Boughattas, Gründer und CEO, ist möglich: [TERMIN BESTÄTIGEN] – schlag uns zwei, drei Zeitfenster vor, wir melden uns mit der Zusage.\n\nZum Material: Logo-Dateien, Markenfarben, Produktfotos und ein Gründerfoto sind in Vorbereitung und stehen bald auf der Presseseite. Bis dahin schicken wir dir [MATERIAL ANHÄNGEN] direkt mit.\n\nDer Absatz von der Presseseite kann wörtlich zitiert werden: txtme.social ist eine europäische Social-Plattform, gebaut um echte Begegnungen. Man verbindet sich nur mit Menschen, die man wirklich getroffen hat, über den persönlichen QR-Code. Kein Algorithmus, keine Werbung, kein endloses Scrollen, kein Tracking. Gegründet in Amsterdam von Marouan Boughattas.\n\nSee you offline.\n\n[Name], txtme.social, Buikslotermeerplein 1726, 1025 XL Amsterdam, The Netherlands, press@txtme.social",
    "team": "Basis: press (boilerplate, press contact, material «soon»)\nOpen: interview date with Marouan; which material can be sent before the press page is complete",
    "englisch": {
     "betreff": "Interview and material for your article",
     "text": "Hi Jonas\n\nThanks for your interest. An interview with Marouan Boughattas, founder and CEO, is possible: [CONFIRM DATE] – suggest two or three time slots and we'll come back with the confirmation.\n\nAbout the material: logo files, brand colours, product photos and a founder photo are being prepared and will be on the press page soon. Until then we send you [ATTACH MATERIAL] directly.\n\nThe paragraph from the press page is free to quote as is: txtme.social is a European social platform built around real-life connection. You only connect with people you have actually met, by scanning their personal QR. No algorithm, no ads, no infinite scroll, no tracking. Founded in Amsterdam by Marouan Boughattas.\n\nSee you offline.\n\n[Name], txtme.social, Buikslotermeerplein 1726, 1025 XL Amsterdam, The Netherlands, press@txtme.social"
    }
   },
   "text_englisch": "Hello, I write for a magazine about European alternatives to the big social media platforms. Would a short interview with the founder be possible, and is there image material and logos for print?"
  },
  {
   "id": "probe-3", "vor": [1, 16, 20], "art": "partner", "name": "Sofia Marin", "email": "sofia@example.com", "sprache": "en",
   "text": "I run a café in Rotterdam. We'd like to be one of the places in the app and maybe sell the shirts at the counter. Who do I talk to and what are the conditions?",
   "consent": true, "source": "support", "erledigt": false,
   "entwurf": {
    "betreff": "Your café as a place in txtme.social",
    "text": "Hi Sofia\n\nGood to hear from you. Cafés, bars and venues that share the same values join the network, and people nearby find them because they're real, not because they paid. So yes, we'd like to talk.\n\nFor business accounts and selling the pieces at the counter, the right address is sales-b2b@txtme.social. The conditions are [CONFIRM TERMS] – we'll send them with the next mail.\n\nCould you tell us a bit more about the café: how many guests on a normal evening, and whether you'd rather start with the place in the app or with the shirts?\n\nSee you offline.\n\n[Name], txtme.social, Buikslotermeerplein 1726, 1025 XL Amsterdam, The Netherlands, sales-b2b@txtme.social",
    "team": "Basis: about (In your city: cafés, bars and venues join the network), support (sales-b2b address)\nOpen: terms for places and resellers are not on the website; forward to sales-b2b"
   }
